{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 50","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A privateer discovers a merchantman <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles to leeward at 11:45 a.m. and with a good breeze bears down upon her at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mph, while the merchantman can only make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> mph in her attempt to escape. After a two hour chase, the top sail of the privateer is carried away; she can now make only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles while the merchantman makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The privateer will overtake the merchantman at:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de2b5581edef775d10b9b6bbec5825fe2ff36ef8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3\\text{:}45\\text{ p.m.} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3\\text{:}30\\text{ p.m.} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\text{:}00\\text{ p.m.} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\text{:}45\\text{ p.m.} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 5\\text{:}30\\text{ p.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"651\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that the two boats are traveling along the positive real number line, with the merchantman starting at the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the privateer starting at the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. After two hours the merchantman is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> while the privateer is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. When the top sail of the privateer is carried away, the speed of the merchantman is unaffected; he still travels at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. Therefore the privateer travels at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f805818d91872e915e0beee37bc6b4ab5d7e268.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17\\cdot \\frac{8}{15}=\\frac{136}{15}=9\\frac{1}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"38\" /> miles per hour. The remaining time <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> in hours it takes for the privateer to catch up to the merchantman satisfied the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/209102dc6412bd18c339068515503950e882ab4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[26+8t=22+\\frac{136}{15}t\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Simplification yields the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01d77920a3d198c29f7850814dfacf176607c8fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16}{15}t=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"38\" />, which shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/a/b2a6891ae7d3c18cb84570b262e12c0f9135c1dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=\\frac{15}{4}=3\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />. It therefore takes a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/8/9c8e9239b3a2b628c95eba73dbb9c819bf10ead7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> hours for the privateer to catch the merchantman, so this will happen at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43fb59f13dd0a20b4dcc557fc59db587670c7aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5\\text{:}30\\text{ p.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At first the privateer travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> mph faster than the merchantman, so over the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours, the privateer gains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/7/b97ac3d6052b56dbdc7cac9881383a38b5968b5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 3 = 6$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> miles on the merchantman.  Therefore, after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours, the privateer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/9/c895eaeac14cc5f479e005a559061e4fbd7dded0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - 6 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> miles behind the merchantman.\n</p><p>After losing her top sail, the privateer travels at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/beff34f27e6d7d2c91b95b63dd3ef59be5d7fe65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{17}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> times the speed of the merchantman, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/b/12b144b139ac95a88beceaa85378464251dda310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot \\frac{17}{15} = \\frac{136}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" /> mph.  Since the privateer now travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/3/393e368c0c3ac1b0b29ef8f3d4aa9c0cfa604744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{136}{15} - 8 = \\frac{16}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" /> mph faster than the merchantman, it will take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/6/fd6662e1ca2d66cf4fa58424f264a6dc5dfc6829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\div \\frac{16}{15} = \\frac{15}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" /> more hours for the privateer to catch up.  \n</p><p>Therefore, it will take a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82db409c634746598216f35d7e79db857cf1e75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + \\frac{15}{4} = \\frac{23}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" /> hours, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes for the privateer to reach the merchantman, so it will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43fb59f13dd0a20b4dcc557fc59db587670c7aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5\\text{:}30\\text{ p.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lAvs2P_YA&amp;t=437s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lAvs2P_YA&amp;t=437s</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.ph